OL,3,AUnexpected UK borrowing surge adds to
OL,4,Apre-Budget pressure on chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unexpected surge in government
OL,7,Fborrowing in August, driven by
OL,8,Fpersistently higher inflation, has
OL,9,Fadded to pressure on Chancellor John
OL,10,FHealey as he prepares to deliver his
OL,11,Ffirst Budget at the end of October.
OL,13,FBorrowing - the difference between tax
OL,14,Freceipts and government spending - was
OL,15,F#18.3bn in August, almost a fifth
OL,16,Fhigher than the year before, the Office
OL,17,Ffor National Statistics (ONS) said.
OL,19,FThat figure was #3.5bn more than
OL,20,Fofficial forecasters expected.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
